+  description: |
+    When sessions.storage is "branch", create orphan branch and worktree
+    at .kspec-sessions/. Auto-commit at lifecycle boundaries (create, close).
+    Independent sync from kspec-meta.
+  implementation_notes: |
+    Reuse shadow branch patterns from src/parser/shadow.ts. Session branch
+    needs its own sync schedule in shadow-sync-scheduler.ts. Commit only on
+    create/close — NOT on event append to avoid the same high-frequency
+    commit issue that caused the original shadow sync conflict.
